---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro'
import { ArrowUpRight, Camera, FileCode2, Github, GitPullRequest, Wrench } from 'lucide-react'
---

<Layout title="Contribute / Badger" description="Share apps, hacks, hardware notes, and experiments with the Badger community.">
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-border/70 py-20 sm:py-24">
    <div class="grid-texture pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-30"></div>
    <div class="container relative">
      <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-6">
        <span class="section-kicker">// OPEN BUILD LOG</span>
        <h1 class="max-w-2xl text-5xl leading-[0.98] sm:text-6xl">Contribute</h1>
        <p class="max-w-2xl text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground sm:text-lg">Share a build, document a fix, or add an app for the Badger 2350.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-2">
          <a href="https://github.com/badger/badger.github.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-primary px-5 font-mono text-sm text-primary-foreground transition-colors hover:bg-primary/85">Open the repo <ArrowUpRight className="h-4 w-4" /></a>
          <a href="#workflow" class="inline-flex h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-border/90 px-5 font-mono text-sm transition-colors hover:border-primary/60 hover:text-primary">Contribution flow <ArrowUpRight className="h-4 w-4" /></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="workflow" class="py-20 sm:py-24">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="mb-10 section-heading"><span class="section-kicker">01 / Workflow</span><h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl">Workflow</h2></div>
      <div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
        <article class="surface p-6 sm:p-8">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4"><div class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary"><Wrench className="h-5 w-5" /></div><div><span class="section-kicker">01</span><h3 class="mt-2 text-xl">Build the thing</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground">Try it on a real badge, keep the setup honest, and capture the version of firmware and hardware you used.</p></div></div>
        </article>
        <article class="surface p-6 sm:p-8">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4"><div class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary"><Camera className="h-5 w-5" /></div><div><span class="section-kicker">02</span><h3 class="mt-2 text-xl">Show the result</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground">A photo, short clip, wiring sketch, or terminal capture gives the idea a useful shape before anyone reads the code.</p></div></div>
        </article>
        <article class="surface p-6 sm:p-8">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4"><div class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary"><FileCode2 className="h-5 w-5" /></div><div><span class="section-kicker">03</span><h3 class="mt-2 text-xl">Write the path</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground">Add a focused MDX page with requirements, steps, code, expected behavior, and the one gotcha you had to learn the hard way.</p></div></div>
        </article>
        <article class="surface p-6 sm:p-8">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4"><div class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary"><GitPullRequest className="h-5 w-5" /></div><div><span class="section-kicker">04</span><h3 class="mt-2 text-xl">Send a pull request</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground">Fork the site, add the content in the existing collection shape, and open a pull request with a short note about what you tested.</p></div></div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-border/70 bg-muted/25 py-20">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr] lg:items-start">
        <div class="section-heading"><span class="section-kicker">02 / Guidelines</span><h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl">Guidelines</h2></div>
        <div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
          <div class="surface p-5"><h3 class="text-base">Include the setup</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground">Badge revision, firmware, parts, tools, and any files that need to be copied.</p></div>
          <div class="surface p-5"><h3 class="text-base">Name the edges</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground">Mention memory limits, pin choices, power behavior, and the failure mode to watch for.</p></div>
          <div class="surface p-5"><h3 class="text-base">Keep it reproducible</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground">Use short steps, tested commands, and images that show the actual result.</p></div>
          <div class="surface p-5"><h3 class="text-base">Leave a next step</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground">Point to the obvious experiment someone can try after they reach the same working state.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap gap-3 border-t border-border/70 pt-8">
        <a href="https://github.com/badger/badger.github.io/fork" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex h-10 items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-border/90 px-4 font-mono text-sm transition-colors hover:border-primary/60 hover:text-primary"><Github className="h-4 w-4" /> Fork the site</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/badger/badger.github.io/discussions" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex h-10 items-center gap-2 rounded-md px-4 font-mono text-sm text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-primary">Ask a question <ArrowUpRight className="h-4 w-4" /></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
